{"actions_summary": [{"can_act": false, "count": 0, "hidden": false, "id": 4}, {"can_act": false, "count": 0, "hidden": false, "id": 8}, {"can_act": false, "count": 0, "hidden": false, "id": 10}, {"can_act": false, "count": 0, "hidden": false, "id": 7}], "archetype": "regular", "archived": false, "bookmarked": false, "bookmarks": [], "can_create_shared_issue": false, "can_vote": false, "category_id": 16, "chunk_size": 20, "closed": false, "created_at": "2026-08-30T08:33:05.191Z", "current_post_number": 1, "deleted_at": null, "deleted_by": null, "details": {"can_edit": false, "created_by": {"avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "id": 15187, "username": "Burnbytes"}, "last_poster": {"avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "id": 15187, "username": "Burnbytes"}, "notification_level": 1, "participants": [{"avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "id": 15187, "post_count": 4, "primary_group_name": null, "trust_level": 0, "username": "Burnbytes"}, {"avatar_template": "/user_avatar/governance.aave.com/raoulschipper-cll/{size}/7228_2.png", "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "id": 11336, "post_count": 1, "primary_group_name": null, "trust_level": 3, "username": "RaoulSchipper-CLL"}, {"avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ee7513/{size}.png", "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "id": 15196, "post_count": 1, "primary_group_name": null, "trust_level": 0, "username": "cconsulting"}]}, "discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id": null, "discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url": "https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/", "draft": null, "draft_key": "topic_25565", "draft_sequence": null, "fancy_title": "Aave v3-v4 liquidation bot", "featured_link": null, "has_accepted_answer": false, "has_cached_summary": false, "has_livestream": null, "has_summary": false, "highest_post_number": 6, "id": 25565, "image_url": null, "last_posted_at": "2026-09-01T05:37:04.755Z", "like_count": 3, "message_bus_last_id": 30, "participant_count": 3, "pinned": false, "pinned_at": null, "pinned_globally": false, "pinned_until": null, "post_stream": {"posts": [{"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "calendar_details": [], "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": false, "can_vote": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>I spent several months building and running a liquidation system for Aave V3 and V4 across Ethereum, Arbitrum and Base. I have written up how it works and am attaching it here.</p>\n<p>There is a lot of public material on MEV in general and very little on how liquidations actually reach Aave. Most descriptions stop at “watch health<br>\nfactors and call liquidationCall”, which skips almost everything that matters once you try to compete. This is the part that gets skipped.<br>\nWhat the document covers:<br>\n•\tThe state engine — census, event listening, and why position health is<br>\ncomputed entirely offline. With scaled balances, reserve indices and prices,<br>\nhealth becomes pure arithmetic, so a price update triggers a local evaluation<br>\nof ~19,000 positions in milliseconds rather than thousands of RPC calls.<br>\n•\tDecoding an SVR frame — the exact structure of a Chainlink Smart Value<br>\nRecapture update, why the report has to be decoded as parameters rather than<br>\nas a tuple, and why filtering by selector alone is not enough.<br>\n•\tFour execution paths, because the chains are not the same:<br>\n•\tAtlas on Arbitrum and Base — solver operations, the owner/signer<br>\nconstraint, the gas ceiling, and why parallel auctions require two bonded<br>\nwallets<br>\n•\tMEV-Share on Ethereum — hash-referenced bundles, why builder multiplexing<br>\nis not optional, and simulating against a state that does not exist yet<br>\n•\tDirect execution — where there is no auction to win, and what the gas<br>\nprofile of that channel reveals about who is using it<br>\n•\tTimeboost via Kairos on Arbitrum — 60-second rounds, the express lane, and<br>\nwhy network latency stops being the constraint<br>\n•\tThe economics — how the bid is calculated, where the liquidation protocol<br>\nfee has to be discounted and where it must not, and a coupling between two<br>\nparameters that silently raises the size floor of the whole system.<br>\n•\tOn-chain execution — flash loan cascades and the fact that providers<br>\ncollect in two incompatible ways, explicit swap routing, batch liquidations,<br>\nand same-asset positions whose health factor is mathematically invariant to<br>\nprice.</p>\n<p>A few measurements are included where they changed how I built things. The one that reframed everything: in a traced auction, the winning liquidator paid of extracted value to the block builder and retained under two dollars. You do not win these by bidding less — you win by having lower costs than the second-best bidder.</p>\n<p>Contract addresses, configuration parameters and wallet details are left out.</p>\n<p>Everything structural is there.</p>\n<p>I am moving my time to other projects and will not be operating this going forward. If anyone is interested in the codebase itself, or wants more detail on any of the above, feel free to reach out and we can discuss it privately.</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/tT5GS4qgv3l7mbZhQYDqBTlBfkm.pdf\">sentinel-architecture.pdf</a> (130.1 KB)</p>", "created_at": "2026-08-30T08:33:05.265Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 65274, "incoming_link_count": 17, "moderator": false, "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot/25565/1", "posts_count": 6, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 0, "reactions": [], "read": true, "readers_count": 24, "reads": 25, "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "score": 90.0, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 25565, "topic_slug": "aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot", "trust_level": 0, "updated_at": "2026-08-30T08:33:05.265Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 15187, "user_title": null, "username": "Burnbytes", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [{"count": 1, "id": 2}], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/governance.aave.com/raoulschipper-cll/{size}/7228_2.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>Hey Burnbytes, Raoul here from Chainlink Labs.</p>\n<p>Would love to chat a bit about your system. Could you reach out to me at <a href=\"mailto:raoul.schipper@smartcontract.com\">raoul.schipper@smartcontract.com</a>?</p>", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:50:30.019Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 65282, "incoming_link_count": 0, "moderator": false, "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot/25565/2", "posts_count": 6, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 1, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "id": "heart", "type": "emoji"}], "read": true, "readers_count": 15, "reads": 16, "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "score": 23.2, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 25565, "topic_slug": "aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot", "trust_level": 3, "updated_at": "2026-08-31T13:50:30.019Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 11336, "user_title": null, "username": "RaoulSchipper-CLL", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>Done.</p>\n<p>Im send you email</p>", "created_at": "2026-08-31T14:39:34.149Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 65283, "incoming_link_count": 0, "moderator": false, "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot/25565/3", "posts_count": 6, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 0, "reactions": [], "read": true, "readers_count": 15, "reads": 16, "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "reply_to_user": {"avatar_template": "/user_avatar/governance.aave.com/raoulschipper-cll/{size}/7228_2.png", "id": 11336, "username": "RaoulSchipper-CLL"}, "score": 3.2, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 25565, "topic_slug": "aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot", "trust_level": 0, "updated_at": "2026-08-31T14:39:34.149Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 15187, "user_title": null, "username": "Burnbytes", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ee7513/{size}.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>Curious to know: is it profitable to run a liquidator bot? I understand this is a game of speed and, as mentioned, “You do not win these by bidding less — you win by having lower costs than the second-best bidder.”</p>", "created_at": "2026-08-31T20:23:07.116Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 65287, "incoming_link_count": 0, "moderator": false, "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot/25565/4", "posts_count": 6, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 0, "reactions": [], "read": true, "readers_count": 10, "reads": 11, "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "score": 7.2, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 25565, "topic_slug": "aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot", "trust_level": 0, "updated_at": "2026-08-31T20:23:07.116Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 15196, "user_title": null, "username": "cconsulting", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [{"count": 1, "id": 2}], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>Speed and latency aren’t as critical as they used to be; with SVR Atlas you have 2 seconds to place your auction bid, and on mainnet, up to 12 seconds.</p>\n<p>Speed is mainly necessary because if you have 90,000 borrowers, scanning and calculating their Health Factor (HF) must be extremely well programmed so you know who drops below 1 and becomes liquidatable.</p>\n<p>The real issue is that bots are bidding higher and higher, barely capturing any of the bonus.</p>\n<p>If you use your own capital to liquidate, you can play with that margin and reduce latency, but if you use flash loans and then swap (adding slippage), the margins shrink drastically.</p>\n<p><strong>A concrete example, traced end to end on-chain.<br>\nAave V3 mainnet, block 25832630. WETH collateral, USDT debt:</strong></p>\n<p>On a $11,809 operation, with a $615 gross bonus, the liquidator kept nothing.</p>\n<p>Every wei of extracted value went out — 99.66% of it to the block builder.</p>\n<p>Their actual return, if any, is whatever cost advantage they hold over the second-best bidder. Not the bonus.</p>\n<p>For context, my own bid on that same auction was $441.40. I lost it, and I would have lost it even bidding 100% of my computed net — my net came out at $520 against their $530, because their route was slightly cheaper and they sized about 0.5% larger.</p>\n<p>That $10 gap is the entire game.</p>\n<p>Debt covered     |**$11,809**</p>\n<p>||Collateral seized|5.0502 WETH — **$12,424**</p>\n<p>| |Gross bonus      |**$614.56** (5.20%)</p>\n<p>After the exit swap, the winning liquidator withdrew <strong>0.2162 WETH ($531.90)</strong>.</p>\n<p>They then paid out:</p>\n<p>|to <code>block.coinbase</code>|0.215488 WETH    |<strong>$530.10 — 99.66%</strong>|<br>\n|to a second address|0.000732 WETH    |$1.80 — 0.34%       |<br>\n|<strong>retained</strong>       |<strong>0.000000 WETH</strong>|<strong>$0.00</strong>           |</p>", "created_at": "2026-09-01T05:24:50.380Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 65292, "incoming_link_count": 0, "moderator": false, "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot/25565/5", "posts_count": 6, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 1, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "id": "heart", "type": "emoji"}], "read": true, "readers_count": 7, "reads": 8, "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "reply_to_user": {"avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ee7513/{size}.png", "id": 15196, "username": "cconsulting"}, "score": 21.6, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 25565, "topic_slug": "aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot", "trust_level": 0, "updated_at": "2026-09-01T05:24:50.380Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 15187, "user_title": null, "username": "Burnbytes", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [{"count": 1, "id": 2}], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": false, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>How do you make money with a liquidation bot? On a day-to-day basis, it’s practically impossible.</p>\n<p>You can only do it during market crash or surge events that trigger price spikes, when there are 100-200 liquidatable borrowers at the same time and the big players can’t handle all of them.</p>\n<p>So on those days, you can make a killing and pull in $1,000 “$2,000 in liquidations in just a few hours.</p>", "created_at": "2026-09-01T05:37:04.755Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 65294, "incoming_link_count": 0, "moderator": false, "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot/25565/6", "posts_count": 6, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 1, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "id": "+1", "type": "emoji"}], "read": true, "readers_count": 7, "reads": 8, "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "reply_to_user": {"avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ccd318/{size}.png", "id": 15187, "username": "Burnbytes"}, "score": 16.6, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 25565, "topic_slug": "aave-v3-v4-liquidation-bot", "trust_level": 0, "updated_at": "2026-09-01T05:37:04.755Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 15187, "user_title": null, "username": "Burnbytes", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}], "stream": [65274, 65282, 65283, 65287, 65292, 65294]}, "posts_count": 6, "related_topics": [{"archetype": "regular", "archived": false, "bookmarked": null, "bumped": true, "bumped_at": "2026-07-28T08:58:31.815Z", "category_id": 4, "closed": true, "created_at": "2026-07-16T18:32:19.577Z", "fancy_title": "[ARFC] SVR Expansion: Next Phase of Multi-Network Expansion", "featured_link": null, "has_accepted_answer": false, "highest_post_number": 2, "id": 25332, "image_url": "https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/aave/optimized/2X/d/d8d9290bb86662bd9c16985fc4535ee2e441ab63_2_1024x570.png", "last_posted_at": "2026-07-28T08:58:31.815Z", "like_count": 6, "liked": null, "op_like_count": 5, "pinned": false, "posters": [{"description": "Original Poster", "extras": null, "user": {"admin": true, "avatar_template": "/user_avatar